.title = "About notizine",
.description = "About the notizine project",
.date = .date("2026-01-01T00:00:00"),
.layout = "page.shtml",
---

**notizine** is an open-source starter template built on top of
[Zine](https://zine-ssg.io), a fast static site generator.

Zine gives you a powerful template engine and content pipeline.
Notizine adds a JSON-like config layer on top - you rearrange modules,
toggle features, and customize layout without touching template code.

Everything you see on this site - the sidebar widgets, the language
switcher, the dark mode toggle - is configured in a single file.
